{
  "method": "Gate the asset-local forecast using the target direction's rolling market-wide hit rate: only make a call when at least half of historical outcomes hit the target. Use signals within 18 calendar months whose outcomes finished strictly before the signal, with at least 100 outcomes, 9 signal months, and 10 assets; otherwise abstain. Evaluate on the same locally eligible signals as the adaptive and asset-local comparators; models select different calls. Unchanged future prices are misses.",
  "limitations": [
    "A research-driven fixed rule tested on previously inspected years is not an untouched or prospective test. Multiple research iterations bias results; intervals do not correct for selection.",
    "The historical rates use overlapping outcomes and highly correlated assets, not independent trials. The market gate is lagging and is not a calibrated probability.",
    "Current selected listings mostly omit delisted assets; local and market history requirements limit coverage. Yahoo crypto differs from Binance. No costs, dividends, slippage or executable same-close entry assumed. No live integration."
